Package: ssKmeans
Type: Package
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-05-12
Title: Semi-Supervised K-Means Algorithm with Positive and Negative Constraints
Authors@R: c(
    person("Emma", "Johnson", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "emma35johnson@gmail.com"),
    person("Volodymyr", "Melnykov", role = "aut"),
    person("Igor", "Melnykov", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements a semi-supervised version of the K-Means algorithm with hard positive and negative constraints. Positive constraints require specified observations to end up in the same cluster, while negative constraints require specified observations or blocks of observations to end up in different clusters. The package returns final membership labels, cluster centers, cluster sizes, a variance estimate, and within- and between-cluster sums of squares.
